{"n": 1282, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1282.webp", "text": "71-1\n\nINSTALLING TRAILER HITCH\nCOMPLETE WITH ELECTRICAL\nCONNECTIONS\n\n7160010\n\nRemove trunk mat and, if applicable, trim on\ntail panel.\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and bolt (2) on left and right\nsides.\n\nUnscrew nuts on left and right sides.\n\nUnscrew bolts on left and right sides.\n\nRemove bumper.\n\nRemove left and right bumper brackets.\n(Brackets are omitted — bumper is mounted on\ntrailer hitch.)\n\n# Unscrew nuts.\nLower final muffler approx. 10 cm (4°) and\nsuspend it from body with a prece of wire\n\nKnock out pre-punched openings (1) on left and\nright sides.\nWhee” Coat opening edges with zine dust paint\n\nPush supports (1) into side members on left and\nright sides.\n\nNote:\n\nIf necessary, recut M 10 tapped bores.\n\n3071015\n\nBolt supports (1) on body hand tight.\n\nFour each M 10 x 20 hexagon head bolts\n\nFour each 10.5 x 30 x 3 washers\n\nImportant!\n\nRemove undercoating on bearing surfaces for\nwashers and coat blank metal surfaces with zinc\ndust paint.\n\n30 T1016", "words": [["71-1", 0.4802, 0.0332, 0.5238, 0.0531], ["INSTALLING", 0.3257, 0.0623, 0.3921, 0.0729], ["TRAILER", 0.3967, 0.0623, 0.4453, 0.0729], ["HITCH", 0.4498, 0.0623, 0.4833, 0.0729], ["COMPLETE", 0.3252, 0.0782, 0.383, 0.0889], ["WITH", 0.387, 0.0782, 0.4149, 0.0889], ["ELECTRICAL", 0.4195, 0.0782, 0.4883, 0.0895], ["CONNECTIONS", 0.3252, 0.0942, 0.4043, 0.1048], ["7160010", 0.2634, 0.0623, 0.3121, 0.0729], ["Remove", 0.2634, 0.2971, 0.3019, 0.3077], ["trunk", 0.305, 0.2984, 0.3308, 0.3077], ["mat", 0.3354, 0.2997, 0.3521, 0.3077], ["and,", 0.3561, 0.2984, 0.3759, 0.309], ["if", 0.3799, 0.2977, 0.386, 0.3077], ["applicable,", 0.3901, 0.2977, 0.4402, 0.3103], ["trim", 0.4443, 0.2997, 0.464, 0.3077], ["on", 0.4681, 0.3004, 0.4792, 0.3077], ["tail", 0.2629, 0.313, 0.2776, 0.3243], ["panel.", 0.2812, 0.3137, 0.3095, 0.3263], ["Unscrew", 0.2629, 0.3302, 0.3034, 0.3402], ["nut", 0.307, 0.3316, 0.3227, 0.3395], ["(1)", 